      "message": "back in the v2.0 only world (pre-grizzly), the ports specified admin (35357) vs non-admin (5000) actions. \n\nin the v3 world, everything should go through port 5000, and we just look at the roles in the token.\n\ni would have thought that if no locationMatch is set for that port, then the idp login shouldn\u0027t be brought up at all, it should just result in a 404 with resource not found... let me dig into this a bit",
